### ============================================================
### Order Tracking & Issue Management API - HTTP Test Requests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. API Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ============================================================
### PART 1: Core Order API
### ============================================================

### 3. Create Order (Success)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-order-create-key-001

{
  "customer_id": "CUST-9876",
  "game_id": "ROV",
  "package_id": "PKG-500-COINS",
  "uid": "PLAYER-ROV-999",
  "server_id": "ASIA",
  "amount": 150.00
}

### 4. Create Order Duplicate Check (Same Idempotency-Key returns cached response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-order-create-key-001

{
  "customer_id": "CUST-9876",
  "game_id": "ROV",
  "package_id": "PKG-500-COINS",
  "uid": "PLAYER-ROV-999",
  "server_id": "ASIA",
  "amount": 150.00
}

### 5. Get Order by OrderNo (Valid - replace with actual generated orderNo)
@sampleOrderNo = {{createOrder.response.body.data.order_no}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}

### 6. Get Order - Invalid format (Must return 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/INVALID-FORMAT-999

### 7. Get Order - Non-existent order (Must return 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD-9999999999999-999

### 8. List Orders - Current Tab (Active: PENDING_PAYMENT, QUEUED, IN_PROGRESS, DELAYED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?tab=current&page=1&limit=10

### 9. List Orders - History Tab (Finalized: COMPLETED, FAILED, EXPIRED, REFUNDED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?tab=history&page=1&limit=10

### 10. Get Order Timeline (History of state changes with timestamps)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/timeline

### 11. Customer Report Issue (Moves active order to DELAYED and records in timeline)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/report-issue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reported_by": "CUST-9876",
  "category": "DELAYED",
  "details": "Order is taking longer than 10 minutes to process"
}

### ============================================================
### PART 2: Bot Flow & 5 Problem Cases Simulation
### ============================================================

### 12. Case 3: Bank Webhook - Timely Payment Confirmation (Moves PENDING_PAYMENT -> QUEUED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/bank
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "EVT-BANK-TX-001",
  "orderNo": "{{sampleOrderNo}}",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "paymentStatus": "SUCCESS",
  "transactionTime": "2026-10-12T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### 13. Case 3: Bank Webhook - Duplicate Webhook Delivery (Returns IDEMPOTENT_IGNORED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/bank
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "EVT-BANK-TX-001",
  "orderNo": "{{sampleOrderNo}}",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "paymentStatus": "SUCCESS",
  "transactionTime": "2026-10-12T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### 14. Case 2: Bot 1 Claims Order Atomically (Moves QUEUED -> IN_PROGRESS with lease)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bot_id": "BOT-WORKER-01",
  "lease_seconds": 60
}

### 15. Case 2: Bot 2 Attempts Race Condition Claim on Same Order (Must return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bot_id": "BOT-WORKER-02",
  "lease_seconds": 60
}

### 16. Case 1: Bot Heartbeat Renewal (Extends lease by 60s)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bot_id": "BOT-WORKER-01",
  "lease_extension_seconds": 60
}

### 17. Bot Completes Top-up (Moves IN_PROGRESS -> COMPLETED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bot_id": "BOT-WORKER-01",
  "external_transaction_id": "PROVIDER-TX-778899"
}

### ============================================================
### Case 4: Permanent Failure (Invalid UID) -> Update UID & Requeue
### ============================================================

### 18. Create Order for Case 4 Test
# @name createOrderCase4
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "CUST-CASE4",
  "game_id": "VALORANT",
  "package_id": "PKG-VP-1000",
  "uid": "WRONG_UID_111",
  "amount": 250.00
}

@case4OrderNo = {{createOrderCase4.response.body.data.order_no}}

### 19. Confirm Payment for Case 4 Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/bank
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "EVT-CASE4-PAYMENT",
  "orderNo": "{{case4OrderNo}}",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "paymentStatus": "SUCCESS",
  "transactionTime": "2026-10-12T12:05:00.000Z"
}

### 20. Bot Claims Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/orders/{{case4OrderNo}}/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bot_id": "BOT-CASE4-WORKER",
  "lease_seconds": 60
}

### 21. Bot Reports Permanent Failure (Invalid UID -> Status becomes FAILED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bots/orders/{{case4OrderNo}}/fail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bot_id": "BOT-CASE4-WORKER",
  "failure_type": "PERMANENT",
  "reason": "Player UID WRONG_UID_111 does not exist in game database"
}

### 22. Customer Corrects UID via Endpoint (Re-queues order: FAILED -> QUEUED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{case4OrderNo}}/update-target
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "CORRECT_UID_99999"
}

### 23. Check Timeline of Case 4 Order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{case4OrderNo}}/timeline

### ============================================================
### Case 5: Background Scheduler Trigger (Lease expiry, Unpaid expiry, SLA check)
### ============================================================

### 24. Trigger Background Recovery Job Cycle Manually
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/trigger-recovery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slaMinutes": 10
}
